-zha","title_eng":"Ne Zha","day":"Indeterminato","favorites":94,"score":"8.43","visite":23635,"studio":"Coco Cartoon","dub":0,"always_home":0,"members":445,"cover":null,"anilist_id":110464,"season":"Estate","title_it":null,"mal_id":40111,"crunchy_id":null,"netflix_id":null,"prime_id":null,"disney_id":null,"pivot":{"anime_id":7177,"related_id":6083,"number":1}},{"id":7177,"user_id":2,"title":"Xin Shen Bang: Nezha Chongsheng","imageurl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116982-DbnQz4JPKwXW.png","plot":"Li Yunxiang, un giovane motociclista che vive nella città di Donghai, scopre di essere in realtà la reincarnazione di Nezha, leggendario eroe vissuto tremila anni prima...","date":"2021","episodes_count":1,"episodes_length":117,"author":" ","created_at":"2025-11-13 21:14:57","status":"Terminato","imageurl_cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116982-3FE2c5yju8fu.jpg","type":"Movie","slug":"new-gods-nezha-reborn","title_eng":"New Gods: Nezha Reborn","day":"Indeterminato","favorites":6,"score":"8.50","visite":4000,"studio":"Light Chaser Animation","dub":0,"always_home":0,"members":31,"cover":null,"anilist_id":116982,"season":"Inverno","title_it":null,"mal_id":44061,"crunchy_id":null,"netflix_id":null,"prime_id":null,"disney_id":null,"pivot":{"anime_id":7177,"related_id":7177,"number":1}},{"id":7178,"user_id":2,"title":"Xin Shen Bang: Nezha Chongsheng (ITA)","imageurl":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116982-DbnQz4JPKwXW.png","plot":"Li Yunxiang, un giovane motociclista che vive nella città di Donghai, scopre di essere in realtà la reincarnazione di Nezha, leggendario eroe vissuto tremila anni prima...","date":"2021","episodes_count":1,"episodes_length":117,"author":" ","created_at":"2025-11-13 21:15:16","status":"Terminato","imageurl_cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116982-3FE2c5yju8fu.jpg","type":"Movie","slug":"new-gods-nezha-reborn-ita","title_eng